# Cloudflare Workers Assets redirects
# Note: www → non-www and http → https redirects must also be configured
# as Cloudflare Redirect Rules in the dashboard (Workers cannot intercept
# requests before the domain resolves at the DNS level).
#
# In the Cloudflare dashboard → Rules → Redirect Rules, add:
#   - (http.host eq "www.isaisendingmetraffic.com") → https://isaisendingmetraffic.com${uri.path} (301)
#   - (http.host eq "isaisendingmetraffic.com" and not ssl) → https://isaisendingmetraffic.com${uri.path} (301)
